  "summary": "Johnnie Harrison Taylor was an American recording artist and songwriter who performed a wide variety of genres, from blues, rhythm and blues, soul, and gospel to pop, doo-wop, and disco. He was initially successful at Stax Records with the number-one R\u0026B hits \"Who's Making Love\" (1968), \"Jody's Got Your Girl and Gone\" (1971) and \"I Believe in You \" (1973), and reached number one on the US pop charts with \"Disco Lady\" in 1976.",
